[PrintTextModified Text:——审判结束的第二天。|#0103Adv01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛在早餐后的放风时间里，<br>将少女们召集到了会客厅。|#0103Adv01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:存活的成员还剩：<br>艾玛、雪莉、汉娜、梅露露、玛格、可可、亚里沙。|#0103Adv01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:再加上失踪的奈叶香，一共八人。|#0103Adv01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（被囚禁在这里还不到一个月……<br>　人数却在不断减少……）|#0103Adv01_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_2 SubId:Middle

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你有什么事要说呢？|#0103Adv01_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，嗯。<br>我想讨论一下越狱的事。其实呢……|#0103Adv01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛正要从口袋里取出，昨晚在娱乐室的收纳柜里发现的<br>老旧的监牢设计图。|#0103Adv01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:哈～艾玛亲还是不长记性呢～<br>整天在吵什么“越狱越狱～！”，差点把命都搭进去了。|#0103Adv01_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果是为了这事才叫大家来，我可要退出了！<br>什么手牵手齐越狱的话题，我是一点兴趣都没有。|#0103Adv01_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛被泼了冷水，手上的动作也停住了。|#0103Adv01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:但、但是可可，你听我说……|#0103Adv01_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:每次都给人无限期待，<br>结果却全是一团糟。<br>别再把我牵扯进去了。|#0103Adv01_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可径直朝出口走去。<br>|#0103Adv01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:等、等一下啊，可可！|#0103Adv01_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你还不明白吗？<br>我就是不想和你一起行动。|#0103Adv01_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

; ＠備考◆言葉に詰まる

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0103Adv01_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，抱歉啊。这不是只针对你，<br>我只是已经不再相信任何人了。|#0103Adv01_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谁会在什么情况下起杀意都说不准，<br>独来独往才是最安全的。|#0103Adv01_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:不会那样的……|#0103Adv01_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛挽留声显得软弱无力。<br>这时可可已经离开了会客厅。|#0103Adv01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当艾玛垂头丧气时，<br>玛格站到了她面前。|#0103Adv01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:很抱歉，但我也赞同可可的观点。<br>我认为最好避免过多的亲近。|#0103Adv01_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:连玛格也……|#0103Adv01_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:关系越是亲密，就越容易滋生嫌隙，<br>不会有好结果的。|#0103Adv01_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果对他人的一丝违和感不断发酵，<br>最终演变成杀意的话——|#0103Adv01_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们还是保持距离比较好。|#0103Adv01_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL11 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……这是说，<br>大家都应该单独行动比较好吗？|#0103Adv01_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:就是这样呢。<br>——喂，艾玛，你总该认清事实了吧？|#0103Adv01_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，认清什么……？|#0103Adv01_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我们之间根本没有什么感情。|#0103Adv01_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

; ＠備考◆はっと息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0103Adv01_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛你也已经开始<br>不信任我了吧？|#0103Adv01_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果对我没有好处，我是不会伸出援手的。<br>抱歉啦。|#0103Adv01_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然脸上挂着温柔的微笑，<br>但玛格的话语却无比残酷。|#0103Adv01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的喉咙只能发出含糊的应声，<br>说不出任何反驳的话。|#0103Adv01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（我们之间没有感情……？）|#0103Adv01_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（感情，<br>　只是我一厢情愿的幻想吗……？）|#0103Adv01_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:二阶堂、城崎、莲见、佐伯、夏目……<br>已经死了五个人了。|#0103Adv01_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……这教训还不够吗。|#0103Adv01_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:连亚里沙也说出了冷漠的话。<br>玛格和亚里沙相继离开了房间。|#0103Adv01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现场只剩下<br>雪莉、汉娜和梅露露。|#0103Adv01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0103Adv01_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0103Adv01_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0103Adv01_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0103Adv01_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:谁都没有开口。|#0103Adv01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（该怎么办……必须说点什么……<br>　但是，我不知道该说什么好啊……）|#0103Adv01_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（其他人可能也和可可、玛格<br>　想的一样）|#0103Adv01_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（觉得不该相信任何人，<br>　应该单打独斗……）|#0103Adv01_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（孤身一人好可怕……好害怕……！）|#0103Adv01_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——就在这时。|#0103Adv01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉轻轻握住了艾玛的手。<br>|#0103Adv01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR11,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，我们一起来吧！|#0103Adv01_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉……？做、做什么？|#0103Adv01_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR11,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:组建好朋友小组啊！|#0103Adv01_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉挺起胸膛，满怀热情地宣布道。|#0103Adv01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被人批判一大通，你不会觉得不甘心吗！<br>明明我们都已经成为好朋友了，不是吗！？|#0103Adv01_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯。|#0103Adv01_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就让她们见识见识！！<br>我们绝对不会分开！！要永远做好朋友！！|#0103Adv01_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着笑容满面的雪莉，<br>艾玛的眼眶渐渐湿润。|#0103Adv01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉……|#0103Adv01_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜叉着腰，<br>深深地叹了口气。|#0103Adv01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR10,ArmL1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:真是的……不懂看气氛的人在这种时候，<br>反而让人觉得松了一口气呢……|#0103Adv01_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟能毫不在意地<br>说出这么肉麻的话呢。|#0103Adv01_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR19,ArmL14 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:说肉麻也太过分了～！<br>我只是说出了心里话而已！|#0103Adv01_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我、<br>我可是在夸你啊……！？|#0103Adv01_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:完全感觉不到是在夸我！|#0103Adv01_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:要夸人就该说“雪莉好可爱最喜欢了”，<br>“真了不起真厉害简直天才”之类的！|#0103Adv01_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:谁会说那种话啊！！|#0103Adv01_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露看着开始争吵的两人，<br>一脸担忧。|#0103Adv01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那、那个，不是说要展示我们关系好吗……<br>吵、吵架是不好的……|#0103Adv01_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露细弱的声音<br>似乎没有传到正在争执的两人耳中。|#0103Adv01_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，她们两个这样反而说明关系很好哦。<br>说不定还能借此发泄压力呢。|#0103Adv01_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是这样吗……|#0103Adv01_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（发泄压力……）|#0103Adv01_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着吵闹的两人，艾玛突然抬起头。|#0103Adv01_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那、那个，大家听我说！|#0103Adv01_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜终于停止了争吵，<br>看向艾玛。|#0103Adv01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我还是觉得独自行动不是正确的选择。<br>和别人在一起才会更开心。|#0103Adv01_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一个人胡思乱想的话压力会越来越大，<br>这样其实不好。|#0103Adv01_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:说得对。<br>压力太大的话，可是会变成魔女的。|#0103Adv01_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR8,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。所以，让我们多做些开心的事吧。|#0103Adv01_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:开心的事，是指……？|#0103Adv01_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL7 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:如果这座监牢想让我们变成魔女，<br>那我们就不能如它所愿。|#0103Adv01_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我还是想计划越狱……<br>但是适当放松也很重要。|#0103Adv01_Ema027| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:大家一起尽情玩乐吧！|#0103Adv01_Ema028| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL8 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:哦～好主意～！<br>还能向其他人展示我们关系有多好！|#0103Adv01_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:也、也是，这想法不错。<br>虽然我并不是特别想和你们组成什么好朋友小组啦。|#0103Adv01_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们就按我们自己的方式来吧。<br>|#0103Adv01_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过……玩什么好呢？<br>艾玛应该有什么好主意吧？|#0103Adv01_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……那个……|#0103Adv01_Ema029| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一时语塞。<br>内心隐约升起一丝恐惧。|#0103Adv01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果说出来冷场了怎么办，<br>如果让她们反感了怎么办。|#0103Adv01_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——不想被讨厌。|#0103Adv01_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样的内心呐喊清晰可闻。|#0103Adv01_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:对、对不起……想不出来……|#0103Adv01_Ema030| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛最终低下头道歉。|#0103Adv01_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时梅露露怯生生地，难得地举起了手。<br>她应该是在担心陷入了尴尬的艾玛。|#0103Adv01_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:那、那、那个，<br>我们来办野餐，怎么样？|#0103Adv01_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:监牢外面很宽敞……<br>感觉大家能体验到出游的氛围。|#0103Adv01_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL8 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:哦！就这么办吧！<br>大家一起去野餐！|#0103Adv01_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我来准备便当……！|#0103Adv01_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR10,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:好朋友野餐大作战开始啦！<br>好开心～！|#0103Adv01_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL7 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:（大家一起野餐啊……）|#0103Adv01_Ema031| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛将手放在胸前。|#0103Adv01_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（最渴望这些时光的，<br>　大概是我吧）|#0103Adv01_Ema032|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（只要能想像着快乐的时光，就还能继续坚持下去）|#0103Adv01_Ema033| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊，说起来……）|#0103Adv01_Ema034| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:那张纸仍放在口袋里，<br>艾玛错过了拿出来的时机。|#0103Adv01_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这个……暂时就只留在我心里吧）|#0103Adv01_Ema035| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不能让大家抱有期待然后又牵扯进危险……<br>　等我更有把握再告诉大家吧）|#0103Adv01_Ema036|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

